Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:04:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1931/3799] soh: rename func_809FE890 ->
 EnDu_PerformCutsceneAction

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: drives position, rotation and animation from csCtx.npcActions[2], including the dance cues 7 and 8
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Du/z_en_du.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Du/z_en_du.c | 15 ++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Du/z_en_du.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Du/z_en_du.c
index 881d56d65..234a795f3 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Du/z_en_du.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Du/z_en_du.c
@@ -16,7 +16,8 @@ void EnDu_DoNothing(EnDu* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_809FE3B4 [LLM:HIG
 void EnDu_WaitForOcarina(EnDu* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_809FE3C0 [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809FE638: once the player leaves its cutscene, opens a OnePointCutscene, faces the player at Darunia and plays NA_BGM_APPEAR
 void EnDu_FireTempleStartScene(EnDu* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_809FE638 [LLM:HIGH]
